And when he was thinking about this, an angel of the Lord appeared to him in a dream and said to him: "Joseph, son of David, do not be afraid to marry Mary, because the child she carries is by the power of the Holy Spirit,
Then she gave birth to a son and said, "We will name him Jesus, because he will save his people from their sins." Luke
